# What of qcar_testbed_integration/ is versioned in the HEAL repo
# (qcar-testbed-integration branch): the physical-testbed code, configs, docs and
# small calibration/label files -- everything needed to go from the real QCars to
# a HEAL dataset. Never the raw data (ROS bags, per-frame folders, built datasets:
# ~27 GB), tensors, result images, or AI-assistant files.
#
# Whitelist: ignore everything at each level, then re-include what is tracked
# (git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded).
# Until 2026-09-24 this folder had its own separate git (10 files); that history is
# backed up at ../../qcar_testbed_integration_git_backup (outside the repo).

/*
!/.gitignore
!/SCRIPTS.md
!/media/
!/notebooks/

!/artifacts/
/artifacts/*
!/artifacts/README.md

# data/: only the tools and the dataset-building pipeline, never the data itself
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/qcar_onboard/
/data/qcar_onboard/*
!/data/qcar_onboard/README.md
!/data/qcar_onboard/_tools/
!/data/qcar_dataset/
/data/qcar_dataset/*
!/data/qcar_dataset/pipeline/
/data/qcar_dataset/pipeline/datasets/
# the root .gitignore's Python-template build/ rule would hide the build scripts
!/data/qcar_dataset/pipeline/scripts/build/
/data/qcar_dataset/pipeline/shared/evidence_through_wall/*.png

# calibration/: tools, report, checksums and the verified intrinsics/extrinsics;
# not the raw fisheye trial blobs (*.bin, ~0.5 MB each)
!/calibration/
/calibration/*
!/calibration/calibration_Matries/
/calibration/calibration_Matries/**/*.bin
/calibration/calibration_Matries/**/*.bin.groups

.ipynb_checkpoints/
__pycache__/
CLAUDE.md
last_session.md
